Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:27.10,Hook,,0,0,0,,LOS DETALLES DE GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué tenemos en el refri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿No hay batidos de\Nproteína?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:03.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Nada de eso?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:05.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me llevo un batido.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:07.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Un batido...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:08.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué es?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Un batido verde?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Mira lo verde que se ve\Npor dentro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:12.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Esto es una locura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Y hasta puedes hacer\Ncosas así!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:18.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué hay en la alacena?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:20.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Dame una barra de\Nproteína.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Hasta se la come con una\Nsola mano, hermano.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Usó la boca para abrir la\Nmaldita envoltura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:26.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío!
